        "title": "00-OVERVIEW - Natural Sciences: Field Taxonomy and Unifying Principles",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "**Key insight**: each scale transition involves *emergence* — the tools that work\nat one level become intractable at the next. Quantum chemistry computes H₂ exactly;\nit cannot compute a protein fold from first principles. That gap *is not ignorance*,\nit is irreducibility, and every field in this library lives in that gap."
